a range of 1-for-10 to 1-for-100, with the Board of Directors of the Company to set the specific ratio and determine the date for the
Reverse Stock Split to be effective.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>&#160;</i></span></p>

